Severity: FAIL
Category: filesystem
Check: check_umask
Fix: Set umask 022 (or 027) in the file.
References: sh(1); umask(1p)
Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST AC-3, CM-6; ISO 8.9; CE Secure configuration

The umask setting in the configuration file is insecure.  Umask must be
set as to prevent public write (i.e. either 002 or 022).
